+# ArbiLend Security Review
+
+**Scope:** all of `src/` at commit `6659e21` (`LendingMarket`, `CollateralVault`, `PriceOracle`, `MarketProxy`, interfaces). Also covered: the deploy config in `README.md` (Arbitrum One, USDC debt, wstETH collateral with the stETH/USD feed) and the listing plan (weETH, ezETH, USDT, then yield-bearing and rebasing tokens).
+**Date:** 2026-09-21
+**Verdict:** **Not deployable.** Right now, anyone can take every USDC in the market and every token in the vault with one transaction (C-1, C-2, C-3). Even with those fixed, the launch config and the health-factor math would liquidate healthy users and overpay liquidators (H-1, H-2).
+
+**How findings were checked:** each Critical/High finding, plus M-1 and M-3, was reproduced with a Foundry test against a copy of the code outside this directory (mock ERC-20s and Chainlink feeds). That copy has since been deleted. Nothing under `src/` was changed.
+
+## Summary
+
+| ID | Severity | Where | Title | PoC |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| C-1 | Critical | `LendingMarket.upgradeTo` | Anyone can upgrade the proxy → drain all USDC and all collateral | ✅ |
+| C-2 | Critical | `LendingMarket.setOracle` | Anyone can swap the oracle → borrow the whole pool with no collateral | ✅ |
+| C-3 | Critical | `LendingMarket.setLiquidationThreshold` | Anyone can set the threshold → liquidate every user, or borrow at 100% LTV | ✅ |
+| H-1 | High | Deploy config / `PriceOracle.getPrice` | wstETH priced with the stETH/USD feed, so collateral is undervalued ~18% and liquidators over-seize | math |
+| H-2 | High | `LendingMarket.healthFactor` | Divides before multiplying: positions under 2× collateral are liquidatable (intended 1.25×) | ✅ |
+| H-3 | High | `LendingMarket.borrowWithSig` | No nonce or deadline: one signature can be replayed forever to push the victim to max debt | ✅ |
+| H-4 | High | `PriceOracle.getPrice` | No staleness, zero-price or sequencer check; a USDC price of 0 lets anyone borrow the whole pool | ✅ |
+| M-1 | Medium | `LendingMarket.liquidateAll` / `_borrow` | Free `borrow(0)` grows `borrowers` without limit, so the keeper sweep runs out of gas | ✅ |
+| M-2 | Medium | `LendingMarket._liquidate` | Liquidation must repay 100% of the debt, and there is no bad-debt handling | – |
+| M-3 | Medium | `CollateralVault.withdraw` | Balance is updated after the transfer: reentrancy doubles a withdrawal (hook-style tokens) | ✅ |
